      "customfield_10001" : "1_*:*_1_*:*_118450481813_*|*_5_*:*_1_*:*_0",
      "customfield_10012" : "0|i004cv:",
      "customfield_10300" : "{}",
      "description" : {
         "content" : [
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "See ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "attrs" : {
                              "href" : "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/14215784/why-cancellationtoken-is-separate-from-cancellationtokensource"
                           },
                           "type" : "link"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : "https://stackoverflow.com/questions/14215784/why-cancellationtoken-is-separate-from-cancellationtokensource",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "and ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "attrs" : {
                              "href" : "https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.threading.cancellationtokensource?view=netframework-4.8"
                           },
                           "type" : "link"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : "https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.threading.cancellationtokensource?view=netframework-4.8",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "and ",
                     "type" : "text"
                  },
                  {
                     "type" : "hardBreak"
                  },
                  {
                     "marks" : [
                        {
                           "attrs" : {
                              "href" : "https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.threading.cancellationtoken?view=netframework-4.8"
                           },
                           "type" : "link"
                        }
                     ],
                     "text" : "https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/dotnet/api/system.threading.cancellationtoken?view=netframework-4.8",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "My current mechanism appears on the surface much simpler to use (no need to explicitly pass around the cancelation tokens).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "But the CancelationToken mechanism works better in supporting tasks that cross multiple threads (e.g.. using athread pool and little mini tasks).",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            },
            {
               "content" : [
                  {
                     "text" : "And my current mechanism has defects with condition variables and blocking (I need to busy wait a little). Not sure if CancelationTokens would solve this or not.",
                     "type" : "text"
                  }
               ],
               "type" : "paragraph"
            }
         ],
         "type" : "doc",
         "version" : 1
      },
